{"5132110": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Rock Paper Viking", "steam_appid": 5132110, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5132110/extras/3eabdd4cc69ded9a092a4071215775bd.avif?t=1787598674\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5132110/extras_big/3eabdd4cc69ded9a092a4071215775bd.webp?t=1787598674 width=1560 height=100 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rock Paper Viking is a pocket game, designed to be relaxing and tailored to your desired play time. Only have 20 min? Load up '10 wave round' and see what loot you can get, while testing your high score. Feel like going longer? Bump up the difficulty and load up '30 wave round' with increased chances of higher level loot and obtaining one of the sacred Runestones!<br><br>This is a casual experience, meant to be enjoyed by all. So jump in and experience the cardboard world of Rock Paper Viking!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5132110/extras/713f8d439830c82f157d2b18b43a5e0b.avif?t=1787598674\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5132110/extras_big/713f8d439830c82f157d2b18b43a5e0b.webp?t=1787598674 width=1560 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5132110/extras/6d504ebbf7a87176b7dff6b1ec6ac568.avif?t=1787598674\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5132110/extras_big/6d504ebbf7a87176b7dff6b1ec6ac568.webp?t=1787598674 width=1560 height=800 /></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_t